{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30592","headline":"望九华山 · 林滋","name":"望九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山突出何怪奇，上有万状无凡姿。\n大者嶙峋若奔兕，小者㠥嵬如婴儿。\n玉柱金茎相拄枝，干空踰碧势参差。\n虚中始讶巨灵擘，阧处乍惊愚叟移。\n萝烟石月相蔽亏，天风褭褭猨咿咿。\n龙潭万古喷飞溜，虎穴几人能得窥。\n吁予比年爱灵境，到此始觉魂神驰。\n如何独得百丈索，直上高峰抛俗羁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林滋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}